   <refbody>  <section>
    <p>Consider a topic that contains a shell command example.</p><table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Fenced code block</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
              <thead>
                <row>
                  <entry> .md input </entry>
                  <entry> DITA output </entry>
                </row>                
              </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>&gt; **Tip**
  &gt;
  &gt; Create notification templates to reduce configuration time.</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>&lt;note type="tip"&gt;
  Create notification templates to reduce configuration time.
  &lt;/note&gt;</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table><p>
            <b>Result:</b> The converter preserves the code block content and generates a DITA <codeph>&lt;codeblock&gt;</codeph> element. The language identifier is retained as an output class when supported.</p>
